{"product_id":"dolci-di-love","title":"Dolci Di Love","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Tuscan town of Montevedova is famous for its rolling green hills, long lazy lunches and delectable cantucci biscuits. It even has its own patron saint. But Manhattan workaholic Lily Turner is not interested in any of that. She's only there to find her cheating husband. But Lily doesn't know that others have plans to find her a happy ending - whether she wants it or not. \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:154 x 235  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Sarah-Kate Lynch \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9780732293260 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 16\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43518564106393,"sku":"14RE9780732293260","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/c5db55ac828b7b633abe2e461e774a4c_f58f70e5-0289-4442-99ce-6250cd54df5b.jpg?v=1698049618","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/dolci-di-love","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}